config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_UBOOT
	bool "sigmastar-uboot"
	help
	  SigmaStar's U-Boot 2015.01, built from the OpenIPC fork at
	  github.com/johnchia/u-boot-sigmastar, which adds a MAC address
	  derived from the NOR part's factory unique ID (infinity6c
	  only). Without it every board answers to the shared fallback
	  00:00:23:34:45:66.

	  Emits images/u-boot-<soc>-nor.bin -- the whole boot container
	  (IPL, GCIS, IPL_CUST, SNI, u-boot), not just u-boot.bin. It is
	  not part of the sysupgrade tarball: mtd0 has no software
	  recovery path, so writing it is a deliberate act with a
	  programmer to hand. `make fullimage` picks it up.

	  https://github.com/johnchia/u-boot-sigmastar
